{"id":"e_galite_","lemma":"égalité","pos":"noun","rank":3630,"glosses":["equality","deuce","tie (in sport)"],"ipa":"/e.ɡa.li.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dc/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Exilexi-%C3%A9galit%C3%A9.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Exilexi-%C3%A9galit%C3%A9.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"égalités"},"formAudio":{"égalités":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-%C3%A9galit%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'aime tous mes enfants à égalité.","en":"I love all my children equally.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"child","l":"enfant"},{"g":"to / at"},null]},{"text":"Nous sommes à égalité.","en":"We're even.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to / at"},null]},{"text":"Je pense que nous sommes à égalité.","en":"I think we're even.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to / at"},null]},{"text":"Il était en faveur de l'égalité pour tous.","en":"He was in favor of equality for all.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"all"}],"phrases":[[2,5,"in favor of"]]},{"text":"Dans les sondages, les deux partis sont à égalité.","en":"In the polls, both parties are on par.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"poll, survey","l":"sondage"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"to go away","l":"partir"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to / at"},null]}]}